      "body": "This actually can never happen because\n\nThis parameter is initialized with cm update rate\nhttps://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/blob/2296fd89e1b362d56c973709c32b030d98f091fc/controller_manager/src/controller_manager.cpp#L2480-L2481\nand only will be changed if great than zero\nhttps://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/blob/2296fd89e1b362d56c973709c32b030d98f091fc/controller_interface/src/controller_interface_base.cpp#L220\n\nBut there should maybe added a check here, just to avoid any regression in the future",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This actually can never happen because</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This parameter is initialized with cm update rate<br>\n</p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/blob/2296fd89e1b362d56c973709c32b030d98f091fc/controller_manager/src/controller_manager.cpp#L2480-L2481\">ros2_control/controller_manager/src/controller_manager.cpp</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n        Lines 2480 to 2481\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/ros-controls/ros2_control/commit/2296fd89e1b362d56c973709c32b030d98f091fc\">2296fd8</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L2480\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"2480\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC2480\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> controller_params.<span class=\"pl-smi\">update_rate</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">get_update_rate</span>(); </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L2481\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"2481\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC2481\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> controller_params.<span class=\"pl-smi\">controller_manager_update_rate</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">get_update_rate</span>(); </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<br>\nand only will be changed if great than zero<br>\n<div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/blob/2296fd89e1b362d56c973709c32b030d98f091fc/controller_interface/src/controller_interface_base.cpp#L220\">ros2_control/controller_interface/src/controller_interface_base.cpp</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 220\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/ros-controls/ros2_control/commit/2296fd89e1b362d56c973709c32b030d98f091fc\">2296fd8</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L220\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"220\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC220\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> (update_rate &gt; <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span> &amp;&amp; params.<span class=\"pl-smi\">controller_manager_update_rate</span> &gt; <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>) </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">But there should maybe added a check here, just to avoid any regression in the future</p>",
